        "question": [
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-q16-stem",
            "role": "stem",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-q16-stem",
                "text": "16. 清华附中校本经典题 我们在课堂上学习了勾股定理后，知道“勾三、股四、弦五”。王老师给出一组数让学生观察：3，4，5；5，12，13；7，24，25；9，40，41……学生发现这些勾股数的勾都是奇数，且从3起就没有间断，于是王老师提出以下问题让学生解决。",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-15",
                    "width": 1219,
                    "height": 1703,
                    "sha256": "7c1a4afec69a94371fa31b6111969ca3d6ec39d7d7c6b1c73764f90316a610dd"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    627.0,
                    120.0,
                    1142.0,
                    348.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-q16-task1",
            "role": "stem",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-q16-task1",
                "text": "请根据上述的规律写出下一组勾股数：11，____，____。",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-15",
                    "width": 1219,
                    "height": 1703,
                    "sha256": "7c1a4afec69a94371fa31b6111969ca3d6ec39d7d7c6b1c73764f90316a610dd"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    665.0,
                    350.0,
                    1140.0,
                    430.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-q16-task2",
            "role": "stem",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-q16-task2",
                "text": "若第一个数用字母a（a为奇数，且a≥3）表示，则后两个数用含a的代数式分别怎么表示？聪明的小明发现每组第二个数有这样的规律：\\(4=\\frac{3^2-1}{2}\\)，\\(12=\\frac{5^2-1}{2}\\)，\\(24=\\frac{7^2-1}{2}\\)……于是他很快表示出了第二个数为\\(\\frac{a^2-1}{2}\\)，则用含a的代数式表示第三个数为____。",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-15",
                    "width": 1219,
                    "height": 1703,
                    "sha256": "7c1a4afec69a94371fa31b6111969ca3d6ec39d7d7c6b1c73764f90316a610dd"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    665.0,
                    432.0,
                    1140.0,
                    779.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-q16-task3",
            "role": "stem",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-q16-task3",
                "text": "用所学知识说明（2）中用字母a表示的三个数是勾股数。",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-15",
                    "width": 1219,
                    "height": 1703,
                    "sha256": "7c1a4afec69a94371fa31b6111969ca3d6ec39d7d7c6b1c73764f90316a610dd"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    665.0,
                    780.0,
                    1140.0,
                    855.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "shared_material": [],
        "answer_candidates": [
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-automatic-row-3c07fe7650f2739d493c9ee9",
            "role": "answer",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-automatic-row-3c07fe7650f2739d493c9ee9",
                "text": "16.解：（1）60 61（2）\\(\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}\\)（3）∵a²+（\\(\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}\\)）²=\\(\\frac{a^{4}+2a^{2}+1}{4}\\)，",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-173",
                    "width": 1148,
                    "height": 1621,
                    "sha256": "a231f0247cd0444cc34ed699c4cca99245d2ac6cfda5ef10a38ca3f8164510be"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    579.0,
                    263.0,
                    1084.0,
                    299.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-automatic-row-702e7841f43c03ec98356f12",
            "role": "answer",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-automatic-row-702e7841f43c03ec98356f12",
                "text": "（\\(\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}\\)）²=\\(\\frac{a^{4}+2a^{2}+1}{4}\\)，∴a²+（\\(\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}\\)）²=（\\(\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}\\)）²。又∵a为奇数，且",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-173",
                    "width": 1148,
                    "height": 1621,
                    "sha256": "a231f0247cd0444cc34ed699c4cca99245d2ac6cfda5ef10a38ca3f8164510be"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    579.0,
                    299.0,
                    1084.0,
                    334.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "fragment_id": "fragment-automatic-row-a309aab8fb02f91a26d8a024",
            "role": "answer",
            "content_type": "text",
            "regions": [
              {
                "region_id": "region-automatic-row-a309aab8fb02f91a26d8a024",
                "text": "a≥3，∴a，\\(\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}\\)，\\(\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}\\)都是正整数。∴a，\\(\\frac{a^{2}-1}{2}\\)，\\(\\frac{a^{2}+1}{2}\\)是勾股数。",
                "box": {
                  "image": {
                    "asset_id": "viewer-173",
                    "width": 1148,
                    "height": 1621,
                    "sha256": "a231f0247cd0444cc34ed699c4cca99245d2ac6cfda5ef10a38ca3f8164510be"
                  },
                  "bbox": [
                    579.0,
                    334.0,
                    1084.0,
                    367.0
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "relation_status": "UNRESOLVED"
